\caption{Geometric decoding and quality-weight allocation in GCDL. (a) A one-dimensional extent illustration; the geometric operation applies independently to width and height. (b) An arithmetic illustration with three eligible weights, not measured training statistics. The sum remains 1.2 and deviations from the mean shrink by a factor of 0.75.}
